sequenceDiagram
    %% OVIC EON — End-to-End Multimodal Data Flow
    %% Document ID: EON-ARCH-DIAG-FLOW-001

    autonumber
    participant Phys as L1: Physical Sensors (Cam/Mic)
    participant HAL as L2: Device Abstraction (HAL)
    participant Perc as L3: Perception Layer
    participant Bus as L5: Core Event Bus
    participant Engines as L4: Engines (ERS / HBU / SIE / ERE)
    participant Mem as L6: Context & Memory
    participant ERG as L4: ERG (Response Gen)
    participant Host as L8: SDK / Robot Controller

    Phys->>HAL: Raw Video Frames & Audio Stream (V4L2 / ALSA)
    Note over HAL: Ephemeral In-Memory Ring Buffers (RAM Only)
    HAL->>Perc: Zero-Copy Frame & Audio Buffers
    Note over Perc: Feature Extraction & Multimodal Quality Gating
    Note over Perc: Zero-Wipe Raw Buffers (Privacy Invariant)
    Perc->>Bus: publish(EventEnvelope[ObservationPayload])
    Bus->>Engines: Route to Subscribers (ERS, HBU, SIE)
    Engines->>Mem: Query Session Context & Active History
    Mem-->>Engines: Return Interaction Context
    Note over Engines: Affective State Update (ERS/EMS)<br/>Turn-Taking Arbitration (SIE)<br/>Cognitive Appraisal CPM (ERE)
    Engines->>Bus: publish(EventEnvelope[ResponseIntentPayload])
    Bus->>ERG: Route Intent, Persona Vector & Context
    Note over ERG: Local SLM Dialogue / Deterministic Template<br/>Piper Neural TTS Audio Streaming
    ERG->>Bus: publish(EventEnvelope[ResponseProposalPayload])
    Bus->>Host: Deliver Proposed Speech Audio & Advisory Gesture
    Note over Host: Robot Certified Safety Controller Validates Corridors<br/>Loudspeaker Audio Playback & Screen Visemes
